    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overall:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu Tien Path is a 3D Xianxia Cultivation game, Fantasy Adventure RPG in UNREAL ENGINE 5.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free on your own path in the world. But you will be loneliness, and very consistency if you want to go to the highest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a part of a web novel, Q-Style with stylized object model and colors world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In mortal world, there are 5 levels in the Xianxia Cultivation Path that a normal human can achieve, of course you must spend blood and bone for it. Consistency and effort are not enough, luck will play a big part in it.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person \u2013 Adventure RPG \u2013 Action \u2013 Shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world \u2013 Flight - Stealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting \u2013 Building \u2013 Farming. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes \u2013 Hidden Objects \u2013 Life &amp; Immersive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/033b5fb871e327a55e3a690f785f4093.poster.avif?t=1752507553\" width=800 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/033b5fb871e327a55e3a690f785f4093.webm?t=1752507553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/033b5fb871e327a55e3a690f785f4093.mp4?t=1752507553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi