amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/4a8db4df6fc9eb1d4d10810a46a7cb57.poster.avif?t=1752507553\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/4a8db4df6fc9eb1d4d10810a46a7cb57.webm?t=1752507553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/4a8db4df6fc9eb1d4d10810a46a7cb57.mp4?t=1752507553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story or Setting:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Xianxia World, almost think Survival of the Strongest, but there is one, don\u2019t want to kill, but live in peace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For powerful Beasts, he tames. For extravagant people who want to kill him, he separates their body and soul. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the whole story, he never kills, but it doesn\u2019t mean he is a good person, there is still a darkness inside.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Benefits:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu Tien Path contains philosophy of Buddhism, Confucianism and Taoism, self-help, mindset of a hard worker.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, just English.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Welcomes:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any feedbacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Request new features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daoist Fellow!</p>",
